        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Tierman:</P><P>I have just learned that another guild is planning to storm SolB on Sunday and take out Naggy then start camping Ragefire.  Now you have a couple choices - try to gather the people that you need (some of us can leave Hate early) and get there before them or try to work something out with them in advance.  Not sure whether they mostly want to kill Naggy for fun and to get jump on Ragefire or if they need drop for someone too.  If they just want to kill a dragon, then we can combine forces.  If they're after epic drops and phat lewt only for themselves, then we have a tough decision to make.  Please let me know off the boards what you would like to do.</P><P>Juror Seraphim<BR>Mystic of the Tribunal<BR>(aka the TDHN events coordinator)<BR><img src="http://home.kscable.com/mvandoren/gat1.jpg" border=0><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
