        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> It is an ongoing dilemma. Naggy is often attacked as soon as he spawns which is why I was hoping to get a jump, knowing his spawn time. I think the only reason he was up for 4 days after the patch was because of the GM event.</P><P>well, since guildwar is not an option :), perhaps if we find out what they are after we can work something out. Which guild is it? I can contact the raid leader.<BR> <BR>If all else fails, it might be possible to meet earlier, buff, camp, set groups etc...and already be in Sol B when Naggy spawns.</P><P>Tierman</P><P><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
